  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "• Preheat oven to 240°C/220°C fan-forced.\n• Cut potato and cauliflower into bite-sized chunks.\n• Place veggies in a baking dish. Drizzle with olive oil, and season with pepper.\n• Toss to coat, then roast until tender, 20-25 minutes. TIP: If your oven tray is crowded, divide the veggies between two trays.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/recipe/step-67b3489a2ccb8b03ddc0f58c-1fec73ef.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Meanwhile, thinly slice red onion.\n• Finely chop garlic. Pick thyme leaves.\n• In a medium bowl, combine a generous drizzle of olive oil, the thyme, panko breadcrumbs (see ingredients). Season with pepper.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/recipe/step-67b3489a2ccb8b03ddc0f58c-058d181f.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• When the veggies have 10 minutes remaining, heat a large frying pan over medium-high heat with the butter and a drizzle of olive oil.\n• Cook onion, stirring, until softened, 4-5 minutes.\n• Add garlic and cook until fragrant, 1-2 minutes.\n• Remove pan from heat. Add Dijon mustard, vegetable stock powder, light cooking cream and Parmesan cheese. Stir to combine. Season to taste.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/recipe/step-67b3489a2ccb8b03ddc0f58c-d327a6fe.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• To baking dish with roasted veggies, pour over the creamy sauce.\n• Sprinkle evenly with the breadcrumb mixture.\n• Bake until golden, 5-10 minutes.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/recipe/step-67b3489a2ccb8b03ddc0f58c-088d896b.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• While the gratin is baking, thinly slice pear into wedges.\n• In a medium bowl, add a drizzle of balsamic vinegar and olive oil. Season, then add pear and mixed salad leaves. Toss to coat.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/recipe/step-67b3489a2ccb8b03ddc0f58c-514e1ae3.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Divide cheesy potato, cauliflower and sage gratin and the pear salad between plates.\n• Enjoy!",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/recipe/step-67b3489a2ccb8b03ddc0f58c-665d7ac5.jpeg"
    }
  ]
